Fix compiling a quantifier that Dafny rewrites to break a matching loop, such as `if j, i :| 0 <= j < 5 && 0 <= i < (j - 1) * (j - 1) + 1 && i * j == 2`: the code referred to an undefined variable. Also fix using a C# assembly as a library when its Dafny source has such a quantifier, or one that Dafny splits, such as `forall i :: 0 <= i < n ==> 0 <= Sq(i) && Sq(i) < 100`: the source that the assembly embeds did not parse, or the quantifier could not be compiled
